{"t":"TMUS","made":"2026-11-13 00:57","name":"T-Mobile US, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","employees":75000,"hq":"Bellevue, WA, United States","website":"https://www.t-mobile.com","summary_en":"T-Mobile US, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides wireless communications services in the United States, Puerto Rico, and the United States Virgin Islands. The company offers voice, messaging, and data services to postpaid, prepaid, and wholesale and other services customers. It also provides wireless devices, including smartphones, wearables, tablets, home broadband gateways, headsets, and other mobile communication devices, as well as accessories; financing through equipment installment plans; reinsurance for device insurance policies and extended warranty contracts. The company offers services under the T-Mobile, Metro by T-Mobile, and Mint Mobile brands through its owned and operated retail stores, customer care channels, national retailers, and its websites, as well as through T-Mobile, Metro by T-Mobile, and Mint Mobile apps. It also sells devices to dealers and other third-party distributors for resale through independent third-party retail outlets and various third-party websites. It has 700 MHz wireless spectrum licenses. The company was founded in 1994 and is headquartered in Bellevue, Washington. T-Mobile US, Inc. operates as a subsidiary of Deutsche Telekom AG.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"T-Mobile US, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국, 푸에르토리코 및 미국령 버진 아일랜드에서 무선 통신 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 후불, 선불, 도매 및 기타 서비스 고객에게 음성, 메시징 및 데이터 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 스마트폰, 웨어러블 기기, 태블릿, 가정용 광대역 게이트웨이, 헤드셋, 기타 모바일 통신 기기 및 액세서리를 포함한 무선 기기도 제공합니다. 장비 설치 계획을 통한 자금 조달; 장치 보험 정책 및 연장 보증 계약에 대한 재보험. 회사는 T-Mobile, Metro by T-Mobile 및 Mint Mobile 브랜드로 자사가 소유하고 운영하는 소매점, 고객 관리 채널, 국내 소매업체 및 웹사이트는 물론 T-Mobile, Metro by T-Mobile 및 Mint Mobile 앱을 통해 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 독립적인 제3자 소매점 및 다양한 제3자 웹사이트를 통한 재판매를 위해 딜러 및 기타 제3자 유통업체에 장치를 판매합니다. 700MHz 무선 스펙트럼 라이센스가 있습니다. 이 회사는 1994년에 설립되었으며 워싱턴주 벨뷰에 본사를 두고 있습니다. T-Mobile US, Inc.는 Deutsche Telekom AG의 자회사로 운영됩니다.","val":{"price":172.8745,"mcap":183121215488.0,"pe":16.670637,"fpe":12.126701,"peg":0.5143,"ps":1.9519188,"pb":3.2631373,"ev_ebitda":8.363,"div":2.72,"beta":0.378,"hi52":224.75,"lo52":143.75},"fin":{"rev":93815996416.0,"rev_g":0.074,"eps_g":0.336,"gross":0.62979,"op":0.22726,"net":0.120459996,"roe":0.19354,"fcf":16360999936.0,"cash":5619999744.0,"debt":118987997184.0,"de":211.32,"eps":10.37,"feps":14.25569},"own":{"short":0.033800002,"inst":0.43522,"insider":0.56256},"analyst":{"n":25,"mean":225.44,"median":235.0,"high":296.0,"low":165.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.60714,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":9,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":9,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":9,"buy":14,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":9,"buy":13,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":235.0,"priorPriceTarget":260.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":165.0,"priorPriceTarget":225.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":258.0,"priorPriceTarget":260.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Scotiabank","ToGrade":"Sector Outperform","FromGrade":"Sector Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":214.0,"priorPriceTarget":212.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"StoneX","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":280.0,"priorPriceTarget":280.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Keybanc","